OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies stealing #100,000 watch
OL,4,Afrom actor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of stealing a Patek
OL,7,FPhilippe watch worth #100,000 from a
OL,8,Ffilm actor in central London has been
OL,9,Ftold he must wait until 2029 for his
OL,10,Ftrial.
OL,12,FRachid Bouchibane, 27, is charged with
OL,13,Frobbing Alexander Johnson of the luxury
OL,14,Fwatch on 10 June 2024 in Westminster.
OL,15,FHe denied a charge of robbery at
OL,16,FSouthwark Crown Court on Monday.
OL,18,FBritish actor and producer Johnson, 39,
OL,19,Fhas appeared in films including Kristen
OL,20,FStewart's The Chronology of Water and
OL,21,Fthe political thriller, The Wizard of
OL,22,Fthe Kremlin.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
