OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies stealing #100,000 watch
OL,4,Afrom actor
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe previously told the Mirror that the
OL,7,Fwatch was a Patek Philippe Aquanaut,
OL,8,Fand said the robbery happened as he
OL,9,Frode home through Mayfair on a Lime
OL,10,Frental bike after an acting audition.
